  "body": "<!--\r\n  Thanks for submitting a pull request!\r\n  Please provide enough information so that others can review your pull request.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR implements `sendEvent` in the following connectors and updates the existing test cases accordingly:\r\n\r\n- connectAutocomplete\r\n- connectGeoSearch\r\n- connectHierarchicalMenu\r\n- connectBreadcrumb\r\n- connectMenu\r\n- connectNumericMenu\r\n- connectRange\r\n- connectRatingMenu\r\n- connectToggleRefinement \r\n\r\n**Stacked PRs**\r\n1. [introduce `insights` middleware](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4446)\r\n2. [send events from hits and refinementList](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4456)\r\n3. [implement sendEvent in all the connectors](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4463) ← current\r\n4. [add tests](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4464)\r\n\r\n## Result\r\n\r\nNow the connectors send event when refining, and expose `sendEvent` at `init` and `render` method.",
